=== PHAN TICH TRADE-OFF: CPPCHECK (TINH) VS ADDRESSSANITIZER (DONG) TRONG PIPELINE CI/CD ===

CAU HOI:
"Neu phai chon CHI MOT cong cu (cppcheck tinh hoac AddressSanitizer dong) de dua vao pipeline CI/CD,
ban chon cong cu nao? Vi sao?"

1. SO SANH CAC TIEU CHI KY THUAT:
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tieu chi                 cppcheck (Phan tich Tinh - SAST)        AddressSanitizer (Phan tich Dong - DAST)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dieu kien thuc thi       Khong can bien dich, khong can chay code. Bat buoc phai bien dich va chay qua test case.
Toc do phan tich         Cuc ky nhanh (vai giay tren toan bo repo). Cham hon (overhead CPU ~2x, RAM ~3x).
Do phu ma (Coverage)     100% moi dong code (ca nhanh hiem gap).  Chi phu tren cac dong ma test suite chay qua.
Do chinh xac (Accuracy)  Co the co False Positives (bao dong gia) Khong bao gio bao dong gia (Zero False Positives).
Kha nang bat loi         Bat tot bien chua khoi tao, cu phap,    Bat tot loi tran bo dem heap/stack,
                         con tro NULL ro rang.                    Use-After-Free, Memory Leak thuc te.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

2. LAP LUAN LUA CHON CHO PIPELINE CI/CD:
- NEU BAT BUOC PHAI CHON CHI DUY NHAT 1 CONG CU CHO PIPELINE CI/CD:
  => LUA CHON TOI UU LA: AddressSanitizer (ASan)!

  LY DO CHINH:
  (1) Tinh xac thuc tuyet doi (Zero False Positive): Trong pipeline CI/CD tu dong, bao dong gia (False Positive)
      la "ke thu" lon nhat vi no lam nghen build, lam phien cac lap trinh vien va giam do tin cay cua he thong.
      ASan chi canh bao khi co hanh vi vi pham bo nho thuc su xay ra tren RAM, moi canh bao deu la loi that 100%.
  (2) Bat duoc cac loi nguy hiem nhat: Cac lo hong nghiem trong nhat (nhu Buffer Overflow CWE-121, Use-After-Free CWE-416)
      thuong lien quan den con tro phuc tap va tinh toan dong luc chay. ASan phat hien chinh xac tuyet doi cac loi nay,
      trong khi cppcheck thuong bo sot khi con tro di qua nhieu tang ham hoac struct phuc tap.
  (3) Tich hop tu nhien vao Unit Test: Moi du an nghiem tuc deu co bo test tu dong (make test). Viec bat co
      `-fsanitize=address` trong qua trinh chay test giup kiem tra toan dien ma khong can them tool rieng.

- GIAI PHAP TOAN DIEN TRONG THUC TE CONG NGHIEP (DEFENSE-IN-DEPTH):
  Trong thuc te, khong nen loai tru ma can phoi hop ca hai theo mo hinh "Shift-Left Security":
  - Stage 1 (Commit/PR Hook): Chay `cppcheck` nhanh trong 5 giay de ngan chan som cac loi so dang (bien chua khoi tao,
    con tro NULL, dead code).
  - Stage 2 (Nightly / Integration Test): Chay bo test day du voi `AddressSanitizer` de phat hien triet de cac loi bo nho
    nguy hiem ma phan tich tinh khong the thay duoc.
